      "role": "user",
      "content": "im trying to get some paperwork together to contact the foreign ministry in luxembourg... i need to formally assert my succession to the House of Valerius regarding the estate holdings that were frozen after the 1922 dissolution. every time i try to reach out they just treat me like a random civilian but i have the genealogical proofs. how do i draft an official notice that they can't just ignore?",
